13:| **Suggestion** | A proposed replacement for a range of the Document. It lives outside the Document (an overlay) until accepted. Holds: range, original text, Replacement, Rationale, refine history. |
15:| **Rationale** | One short sentence from the AI explaining the change, in the Document's language. Shown on hover, or when the cursor is inside the Suggestion; always shown on the Active Suggestion's margin card. |
16:| **Active Suggestion** | The one containing the cursor; otherwise the most recently asked Suggestion; otherwise the most important open Review pass Suggestion. The only one whose Card has Accept / Reject / Refine. |
17:| **Card** | The box tied to a Suggestion with its Rationale, plus Accept / Reject / Refine on the Active Suggestion. A margin card sits right of the text, level with the Suggestion's first line, when the window has room; otherwise the Card floats above the Suggestion. |
20:| **Refine** | A follow-up Instruction on an open Suggestion. Produces a new Replacement in place. The diff is always against the original text. Each step (the first request plus each Refine) is a version; the Card's arrows `‹ n / m ›` switch between them. |
